===Noun===
{{en-noun|-|+}}

# {{lb|en|pathology}} A common [[childhood]] [[disease]] caused by the [[varicella zoster virus]] ([[VZV]]), {{taxlink|Human alphaherpesvirus 3|species|noshow=1|ver=161006}} ({{vern|HHV-3}}).

